      "problem": "$|\\begin{aligned}5 & -2 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 2 & -3 & -2 & 5 \\\\ 7 & 2 & 4 & 3 \\\\ 3 & -6 & 2 & -8\\end{aligned}|=$",
